    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 71, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "宽阔的大厅中央设有底座，<br>\n以及供各位囚犯站立的证人席。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0102Adv26_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 73, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛已是第二次踏进这里，但那肃穆依旧的氛围<br>\n让她的腿都在打颤。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0102Adv26_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 75, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看守把守在大门前，<br>\n典狱长高高在上的画面也一如既往。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0102Adv26_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 77, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所有囚犯少女均已就位。<br>\n大家都被奈叶香的出现惊讶得屏住呼吸。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0102Adv26_Narrative013"]}},
